<title>MEXICO: Mexico lowers prices for jet fuel - Pemex.</title>
<headline>Mexico lowers prices for jet fuel - Pemex.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state-owned oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) lowered Wednesday the price it charges for jet fuel to 1,704.15 pesos from 1,764.42 pesos per cubic meter.</p>
<p>Pemex said it adjusted prices to conform with international jet fuel prices.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
